{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d103e9ebf91063e63e23b6ddf7c74f423ce28e2c1651f8a260fd2f9cf4e92d7d", "ja": "（今日は浅草で麗花の撮影。空き時間ができたので、\n一緒に浅草観光をする事になった）", "zh": "（今天是在浅草给丽花拍摄。因为有了空闲时间，决定一起游览浅草。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "d90d5188f281073598c699c847201c0713e611aca19ceac32734466a684af7db", "ja": "わーい！　{$P$}さん、\n人力車に乗るの、楽しかったですね♪", "zh": "哇——！{$P$}先生，坐人力车真开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "c240ed8b012994e3d63cfa1afbbee8785516e8ae6b74bec96d1314b4b7dbe674", "ja": "車を引っ張る人、すごく江戸っ子って感じで……。\n私もやってみたいです。へい、くるまえび一丁あがり！", "zh": "拉车的人，感觉特别有江户风情……。\n我也想试试看。嘿，车虾一份出炉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0192618d574a528b5c4e66f36d61199573574f1b9da4f907e3be02c358fd43c9", "ja": "それはお寿司屋さんじゃないか？\n車つながりみたいだけど……。", "zh": "那不就是寿司店吗？虽然好像都是和“车”有关……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "9e8187737da7c810da3f7f459723f4bfa4cb54f23fdccfdd40da00ed0f858df7", "ja": "それもそうですね！　……なんだかエビさんのことを\n話したら、お腹が空いてきちゃいました！", "zh": "确实如此！……不知怎么的，一聊到虾，我就有点饿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1005_p", "source_sha256": "953e9d8400bfa03717d2e1db7f2c9f7afd6db67c4213158de3ecee6f155efae4", "ja": "そろそろ腹ごしらえしようか。確か近くに、\n評判のお好み焼き屋さんがあったような……？", "zh": "差不多该填填肚子了。记得附近好像有一家口碑不错的大阪烧店……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "19e0157586df0ea5d96bc970ac745eef1b7deedcc1f4f1301485d5420e2c2cff", "ja": "お好み焼き、いいですね！　余り物を\nぽいぽいっと入れても美味しくなりますから。", "zh": "大阪烧，很不错呢！就算把剩下的食材随手丢进去，也能变得很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1007_p", "source_sha256": "47faff342f44864ce55d609318050cea582655395ddfd43f498f9638594992be", "ja": "おっ、その口ぶりだと、家でも結構作るのか？", "zh": "哦，听你这语气，你在家里也经常做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "8fdb83b627d07b6300086fd829fdbe56727ee742cbc59638ce78160b5a06a918", "ja": "はい！　私、好きなものたくさんあるから、いつも\nなにを入れるか迷っちゃって……。", "zh": "是的！我喜欢的东西很多，所以总是会纠结要放什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "b05e633d582180d0a1be91ffe47ff99fce4c9d3c951a55eace3fe8448205eab3", "ja": "お店についたら{$P$}さんの分も、\n私が焼いちゃいますね！　何焼きにしようかな～？", "zh": "到了店里，{$P$}先生的那份也由我来烤吧！烤什么好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "920685f8f0f8d91375bc2bfc47b6fc03c42ff0b4c3c06fd18d4f7ce9876da697", "ja": "チョコ味かな？　ミント味？　あっ、安心して\nください。キレイに焼くの得意なんです♪", "zh": "巧克力味？薄荷味？啊，请放心，我很擅长把它烤得漂漂亮亮的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e2dec230f36924a1b9ba227bd5600f860876202582dd935b455c04bad61df677", "ja": "いや、ええと……味は普通のミックスがいいな。\n今日はそういう気分なんだ。", "zh": "不，那个……口味就选普通的混合口味吧。今天就是想吃这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "d9444f7f4210f5cc288abe383fc57f9254bcd8aed7a56b9980bd81e45a226099", "ja": "普通ですか？　さすがですね♪　なら私も、\n{$P$}さんと同じのにしよっと。", "zh": "普通口味吗？果然厉害呢♪那我也要\n跟{$P$}先生一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "359b0e551a511479883377ff851bc43132c0fb0b3cdea060d97f15035de6368f", "ja": "あ、でもでも、焼き方は任せてくれますよね？\n私のお好みアームがうなりますよ。ブンブン♪", "zh": "啊，不过烤法就交给我，没问题吧？\n我的随心手臂要发威啦。呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1014_p", "source_sha256": "52b53797dd01f40ada9f6767423eda3f809d72641fe1d50b6a62c1e2ddab3485", "ja": "あ、うん、じゃあ……お願いしようかな。\nよろしく！", "zh": "啊，好，那就……拜托你了。\n请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "dcfe148f55b44e51639f96bb0af3c1b8eabfdd033fbf62f2b8ae5d316e343b13", "ja": "はーい♪　好きな青のりとか、好きなマヨネーズとか、\n教えてくださいね？　がんばりまーす！", "zh": "好——♪　喜欢的青海苔、喜欢的蛋黄酱之类的，\n请告诉我哦？我会加油的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0283_1016_p", "source_sha256": "45759d72c1e48da497693e74665cbfaca1c58673feb5af784d5c97cf399277c9", "ja": "（その後は、麗花とたっぷり、\nお好み焼きを楽しんだ。良い浅草巡りになったな！）", "zh": "（之后和丽花尽情享用了御好烧。这次浅草之行真不错啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
